WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.946
Konnektora helps businesses and organisers connect with their
communities.

00:00:05.946 --> 00:00:15.589
Present your events and places, maintain information
participants need and become discoverable through shared
interests.

00:00:15.589 --> 00:00:22.500
Review business account details and manager permissions before
using management tools.

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:26.982
Clear event information helps participants decide.

00:00:26.982 --> 00:00:33.705
State the description, date, time zone, location and
attendance conditions.

00:00:33.705 --> 00:00:41.235
Choose public, approval-based or invitation-only attendance
according to your needs.

00:00:41.235 --> 00:00:45.000
Keep details up to date when plans change.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:50.827
Relevant interests help communities discover your event or
place.

00:00:50.827 --> 00:00:55.309
Choose topics that match the experience you offer.

00:00:55.309 --> 00:01:00.149
Share useful information and communicate respectfully.

00:01:00.149 --> 00:01:07.500
Access invitation and participation information only within
your authorised scope.

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:16.361
Authorised teams can use invitations, participation records
and, on eligible accounts, guest lists and entry tools.

00:01:16.361 --> 00:01:21.062
QR or NFC availability depends on device and browser support.

00:01:21.062 --> 00:01:25.916
Review analytics in the context of the relevant event or
place.

00:01:25.916 --> 00:01:30.000
Use the Help Centre and support if you need guidance.
